静まり返り
Falling silent,

3
00:03:39,150 --> 00:03:42,350
眠る街を駆けゆく
running through the sleeping town,

4
00:03:42,350 --> 00:03:44,850
吹き抜け踊る
dancing in the wind,

5
00:03:44,850 --> 00:03:49,100
風に乗り夜の淵へ
riding the wind to the edge of the night.

6
00:03:49,100 --> 00:03:55,550
輝く月が その横顔を捉える
The shining moon catches your profile.

7
00:03:55,550 --> 00:04:02,150
冷たく光る 左手は何を掴む
Shining coldly, what does your left hand grasp?

8
00:04:02,150 --> 00:04:08,350
解れゆく世界の 欠片をひとひら
A single fragment of the unravelling world,

9
00:04:08,350 --> 00:04:14,350
意志の火を片手に 翳り歩く
walking in the shadows with the fire of will in hand.

10
00:04:14,350 --> 00:04:20,850
終わりなど見えない 仕組みなのだから
Because this is a system where no end is in sight,

11
00:04:20,850 --> 00:04:27,550
問う事は諦め 一つ一つ
giving up on questioning, one by one.

12
00:04:27,550 --> 00:04:34,050
糸茎途切れ 気付けば唯一の針
Threads cut off, before I knew it, the only needle

13
00:04:34,050 --> 00:04:40,950
縋る事さえ 許されずに膝を折る
unable to even cling to it, I fall to my knees.

14
00:04:40,950 --> 00:04:47,250
水面に映る ツギハギだらけの身体
Reflected on the water's surface, a patched-up body,

15
00:04:47,250 --> 00:04:53,950
空蝉に問う これは夢か幻か
asking the empty shell: is this a dream or an illusion?

16
00:04:53,950 --> 00:04:59,600
くたびれては眠り 赤い夢を見る
Growing weary, I fall asleep and see a red dream.

17
00:05:00,208 --> 00:05:01,108
空蝉に問う
Asking the empty shell,

18
00:05:01,358 --> 00:05:05,808
篝火は倒れて 空を焦がす
Bonfires collapse and scorch the sky.

19
00:05:07,108 --> 00:05:09,008
責き立てられるように
As if being urged on,

20
00:05:09,508 --> 00:05:12,508
泥裏に歩き出す
I step out into the mud.

21
00:05:13,508 --> 00:05:18,008
孤独な太陽の様に 繰り返しで
Like a lonely sun, repeating endlessly...

22
00:05:40,008 --> 00:05:49,008
繋ぎ止める 全ての火を
Binding and holding back all the flames...

23
00:06:03,508 --> 00:06:06,008
澄み切った青空
A crystal-clear blue sky,

24
00:06:06,508 --> 00:06:09,508
岩陰にもたれて
Leaning against the shade of a rock,

25
00:06:10,008 --> 00:06:17,008
頬撫でてゆく風は「おやすみ」と呟いた
The wind caressing my cheeks whispered, "Good night."

26
00:06:22,508 --> 00:06:28,008
ほつれ ほつれ 片手に戻る 現世の記憶は
Unraveling, returning to pieces, memories of this world are...

27
00:06:29,008 --> 00:06:34,008
無残の瀬戸際を未だ見ず
Still unable to see the ruthless brink,

28
00:06:34,508 --> 00:06:41,508
辛うじて留める形を繋ぐ 冴えない魔法は
Barely holding together its shape, this dull magic is...

29
00:06:42,008 --> 00:06:46,508
掛け替えの無い命の影
The shadow of an irreplaceable life.

30
00:06:47,008 --> 00:06:53,808
動かぬその右手には クチナシの花束を
In that motionless right hand, a bouquet of gardenias,

31
00:06:54,008 --> 00:06:59,808
地に返る魂に捧ぐ 花向け
Offered as a farewell to the soul returning to earth.

32
00:07:00,008 --> 00:07:06,008
残された世界には 朽ちなしの絶望と
